{"parse": {"title": "FX-06", "pageid": 55390, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/FX-05\" title=\"FX-05\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">FX-06</span><a href=\"/wiki/FX-07\" title=\"FX-07\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">FX</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">06</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E4.B8.87.E8.83.BD.E8.A7.A3\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"万能解\">万能解</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 万能解</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">An Explosive Answer</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>爆<span class=\"color-value\"></span>炸<span class=\"color-value\"></span>是<span class=\"color-value\"></span>一<span class=\"color-value\"></span>种<span class=\"color-value\"></span>真<span class=\"color-value\"></span>正<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>万<span class=\"color-value\"></span>能<span class=\"color-value\"></span>艺<span class=\"color-value\"></span>术<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 191106</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-linzhongshenchu_zhou.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"linzhongshenchu_zhou\"><img alt=\"linzhongshenchu_zhou\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/Cg-linzhongshenchu_zhou.png/600px-Cg-linzhongshenchu_zhou.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/Cg-linzhongshenchu_zhou.png/900px-Cg-linzhongshenchu_zhou.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/Cg-linzhongshenchu_zhou.png/1200px-Cg-linzhongshenchu_zhou.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>建筑轰塌。烟雾，尘霾，四散开来。一场人工的地震。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>《童子军手册》上找不到应对方法的灾难。她只能目睹一切发生，而后木讷地伫立。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>此刻纯然的旁观者也正是麻烦的制造者。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301010.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/45/HeadIconSmall-301010.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301010.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301010.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/45/HeadIconSmall-301010.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301010.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/45/HeadIconSmall-301010.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301010.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>咳，咳咳！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>虽然在意料之中，但亲眼看过，感觉还是非常的……壮观。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>……X先生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>嗯？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>我以为这是——我以为你说这是烟雾处理器。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>没错啊。把产生工业雾霾的源头掐灭，难道不是更为有效的烟雾处理方式吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>可是、可是这不对……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>我保证，朋友。这绝对没有任何问题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>在你来之前，已经有人对工厂进行了人员疏散。因此在这过程中没有任何人类或者神秘学家受到伤害。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>那附近的魔精——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>也没有魔精受到伤害！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>甚至……我觉得都不一定有人听到了动静。毕竟外面有迷障网，爆炸一气呵成，也足够干净利落。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>我、我不是在说这个，而且你说的那个迷障网——它已经失效了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>哦，但就算迷障网失效了也没关系。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>就像你并不是拉普拉斯的实习生，也没什么关系。 </div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>什么……？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的手，几乎将那块怀表攥得滚烫。仿若一块烧红的烙铁，隔着骨肉与胸腔猛烈地共振。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>你不是拉普拉斯的人，却找到了迷障网的破绽。听说他们为了迭代试验了几万次，应该没那么容易被破解。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>我很好奇。你究竟是用什么东西追踪到这里的，硕鼠血吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>不是！是我的神秘术……不对。那你——你到底，是不是泽维尔？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>我说过了，我是“X”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>是的。眼前的少年重复过许多次，而她却固执地忽略了这些现在看来异常明显的痕迹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>……是的，是的。你说过。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>你说过……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>越来越近的、吵嚷的人声突然盖过了真相揭露的恍然时刻。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"562901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/HeadIconSmall-562901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-562901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"562901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/HeadIconSmall-562901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-562901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/HeadIconSmall-562901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-562901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">童子军Ⅰ：</div><div>——我就说了<span style=\"font-size:111%\">我有办法！</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"562901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/HeadIconSmall-562901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-562901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"562901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/HeadIconSmall-562901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-562901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/HeadIconSmall-562901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-562901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">童子军Ⅰ：</div><div>等着吧，动静这么大，泽维尔肯定吓坏了，会自己跑出来的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>看来，迷障网的确失效了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>我——我还得去找真正的泽维尔。我先——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"562901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/HeadIconSmall-562901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-562901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"562901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/HeadIconSmall-562901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-562901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/HeadIconSmall-562901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-562901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">童子军Ⅰ：</div><div>咦？你不是那个总缠着教官的人吗？他都告诉你一百次了，你不可能加入童子军的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>……我没有总缠着教官，而且也没有一百次。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"562901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/HeadIconSmall-562901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-562901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"562901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/HeadIconSmall-562901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-562901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/HeadIconSmall-562901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-562901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">童子军Ⅰ：</div><div>放弃吧，穿裙子是加入不了童子军的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>关于这一点，我想苏格兰的童子军协会肯定有不同的意见……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"562901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/HeadIconSmall-562901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-562901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"562901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/HeadIconSmall-562901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-562901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/HeadIconSmall-562901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-562901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">童子军Ⅰ：</div><div>你又是谁？反正，反正华盛顿童子军协会是不会接受一个小姑娘的，你身上那块破布也离真正的绶带差得远呢！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>请让开。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"563001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-563001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-563001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"563001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-563001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-563001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-563001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-563001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">童子军Ⅱ：</div><div>等等，这个废墟……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"562901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/HeadIconSmall-562901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-562901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"562901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/HeadIconSmall-562901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-562901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/HeadIconSmall-562901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-562901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">童子军Ⅰ：</div><div>肯定是他们弄出来的，泽维尔说不定都被埋在里面了！弄丢搜救对象，你还想加入童子军？ </div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"562901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/HeadIconSmall-562901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-562901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"562901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/HeadIconSmall-562901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-562901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/HeadIconSmall-562901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-562901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">童子军Ⅰ：</div><div>你这样的表现，甚至没有人会在欢迎会上和你交换手帕！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>泽维尔没有——X先生说没有产生伤亡！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"562901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/HeadIconSmall-562901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-562901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"562901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/HeadIconSmall-562901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-562901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/HeadIconSmall-562901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-562901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">童子军Ⅰ：</div><div>乔治他们怎么还没来，我就说这边肯定有收获。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>……我要走了。请让一让。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"562901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/HeadIconSmall-562901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-562901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"562901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/HeadIconSmall-562901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-562901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/HeadIconSmall-562901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-562901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">童子军Ⅰ：</div><div>谁允许你走了？我们现在要彻底打消你的妄想！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>不好意思。你们到底想做什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"563001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-563001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-563001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"563001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-563001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-563001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-563001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-563001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">童子军Ⅱ：</div><div>如果我们找不到泽维尔，那么作为可能破坏了现场的人，你们需要跟我们回去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>我会找到泽维尔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"562901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/HeadIconSmall-562901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-562901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"562901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/HeadIconSmall-562901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-562901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/HeadIconSmall-562901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-562901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">童子军Ⅰ：</div><div>你怎么找？你什么都不知道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>男孩们示威似地向前走出几步，站到小春雀儿的面前，摆开要拦住她的架势。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>尽管身量的差距并不显著，但对她来说，眼前的人身上穿着的、真正的童子军制服，比所有挑衅的话语与表情都更为刺眼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>……如果他不在这里，就会在其他的地方。总之——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>总之你会找到他。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>现在这地方几乎一览无余了，你会找到泽维尔的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>而且……知道吗？就算你没有找到，你也可以和我一起回拉普拉斯。 </div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>思虑过多的小孩总是想做些什么。而恰好，你的能力看上去能做的事还有更多。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>想不想看看别的路怎么走？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小春雀儿望着他，似乎听不明白那些话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>半晌，她决定先解决当下，于是轻轻地摇头了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>……不，谢谢你。我可以找到的，我可以用我的神秘——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>冲撞的思绪使想要证明自己的话滚到舌尖。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>只需轻轻一推，一切为她所知的真相都将摊开在所有人的面前。而后，她也将离成为童子军的未来愈远。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>——如果她没有被一阵轻微的呜咽声打断。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/HeadIconSmall-611902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/HeadIconSmall-611902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/HeadIconSmall-611902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小狗：</div><div>呜……汪呜……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小狗亲切地蹭了蹭小春雀儿的裤腿，残留在毛发间的饼干碎屑落到了地上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>嗯？是你？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"562901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/HeadIconSmall-562901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-562901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"562901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/HeadIconSmall-562901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-562901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/HeadIconSmall-562901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-562901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">童子军Ⅰ：</div><div>咦？泽维尔？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>回答几人的，是一阵表达确认的犬类叫声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/HeadIconSmall-611902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/HeadIconSmall-611902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/HeadIconSmall-611902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“泽维尔”：</div><div>嗷！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>……哦。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "FX-06"}}